"p": 11}, {"w": "come", "s": 64.609, "e": 64.783, "p": 11}, {"w": "inside", "s": 64.818, "e": 65.224, "p": 11}, {"w": "and", "s": 65.247, "e": 65.317, "p": 11}, {"w": "give", "s": 65.375, "e": 65.515, "p": 11}, {"w": "that", "s": 65.538, "e": 65.654, "p": 11}, {"w": "idea", "s": 65.712, "e": 65.979, "p": 11}, {"w": "somewhere", "s": 66.049, "e": 66.327, "p": 11}, {"w": "to", "s": 66.35, "e": 66.397, "p": 11}, {"w": "go.", "s": 66.455, "e": 67.105, "p": 11}], "paras": [{"s": 0.6, "e": 3.851, "text": "What's a problem you understand well enough to build a business around?"}, {"s": 4.151, "e": 13.299, "text": "Maybe you know an industry where leads get ignored. Maybe you see businesses spending hours on something that could be automated. Maybe you have an idea for software you wish existed."}, {"s": 13.599, "e": 19.822, "text": "With AI and platforms like GoHighLevel, you can start turning those ideas into something people can use."}, {"s": 20.122, "e": 21.794, "text": "But the tools are only part of it."}, {"s": 22.094, "e": 27.76, "text": "You still need to choose a customer, build something they want, create an offer, and learn how to sell and deliver it."}, {"s": 28.06, "e": 29.964, "text": "That's what we work on inside this community."}, {"s": 30.264, "e": 37.88, "text": "I'm sharing my strategies, training, skills, and tools to help you start and grow an online business using AI and SaaS."}, {"s": 38.18, "e": 45.703, "text": "You can learn how to use GoHighLevel as a foundation, use AI to help you build, and develop systems for reaching customers and serving them."}, {"s": 46.003, "e": 51.344, "text": "You'll get exclusive resource drops, new trainings, coaching, and updates as this space changes."}, {"s": 51.644, "e": 56.195, "text": "You can bring an early idea, a project you've already started, or a business you want to grow."}, {"s": 56.495, "e": 61.836, "text": "Then use the community to work through your next move, get feedback, and keep making progress."}, {"s": 62.136, "e": 67.105, "text": "If you've been thinking about building something of your own, come inside and give that idea somewhere to go."}]}